    "title": "Sample: Right Triangles & Pythagoras",
    "description": "A ready-made sample course: two illustrated lessons with a video, a quiz and a boss battle on right triangles and the Pythagorean theorem. Edit anything — it’s your copy.",
    "joinCode": "SMPMATH1",
    "module": {
      "id": "cbae1749-bc05-5612-8061-da674ad67c86",
      "title": "Unit 1: Right triangles",
