      {
        "id": "9bc858eb-3ea7-5435-a35c-ff4c53fb3549",
        "kind": "lesson",
        "xpSource": "lesson_completion",
        "title": "Rocky worlds and giants",
        "summary": "Inner and outer planets compared, and what makes Earth special.",
        "body": "## Two kinds of planet\n\nThe four **inner planets** — Mercury, Venus, Earth and Mars — are small and **rocky**, with solid surfaces. The four **outer planets** are **giants** made mostly of gas and ice, with no solid surface to stand on.\n\n| | Inner planets | Outer planets |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Made of | Rock and metal | Gas (hydrogen, helium) and ice |\n| Size | Small | Huge |\n| Moons | Few or none | Many |\n| Rings | None | All four have rings |\n\n## A giant up close: Jupiter\n\n![Jupiter, showing its coloured cloud bands and the Great Red Spot](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Jupiter_and_its_shrunken_Great_Red_Spot.jpg?width=800 \"Jupiter photographed by the Hubble Space Telescope. The Great Red Spot is a storm wider than Earth. Image: NASA, ESA and A. Simon (Goddard Space Flight Center), public domain, via Wikimedia Commons\")\n\nJupiter is so big that more than 1,000 Earths could fit inside it. Its stripes are bands of cloud blown by powerful winds.\n\n## Our home: Earth\n\n![Earth seen from space, showing Africa, Antarctica and swirling clouds](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/The_Earth_seen_from_Apollo_17.jpg?width=800 \"Earth photographed by the Apollo 17 crew in 1972, on their way to the Moon. Image: NASA, public domain, via Wikimedia Commons\")\n\nEarth is special because it is the right distance from the Sun for **liquid water** to exist on its surface. It also has an atmosphere that contains oxygen and protects us from harmful radiation. As far as we know, it is the only place in the universe with life.\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **What about Pluto?** In 2006 astronomers reclassified Pluto as a **dwarf planet**, because it hasn’t cleared other objects out of its orbit.",
        "objectives": [
          "Compare the inner rocky planets with the outer giant planets",
          "Describe what makes Earth special"
        ],
        "difficulty": 1,
